$\beta $\end{document}C connectivity and basic amino acid encoding. (C) Using flexible number of pre-trained language models to obtain amino acid node level embeddings. Then extract the informative feature through multiple MRSN modules. (D) Aggregating amino acid features extracted by language models into peptide graphs. (E) Applying the GAT and fully connected layers for peptide property prediction.

